        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160158213?u=24cc7b7b6e2b8a5b15ed178d43a856ebb7a126ac&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #45164.\">Closes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5167009985\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45164\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45164/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45164\">#45164</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">librsvg</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">resvg</code> to .vscode/dictionaries/proper-names.txt.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Both words appear in files/en-us/web/svg/tutorials/svg_from_scratch/<br>\ntools_for_svg/index.md and are project names used correctly:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>librsvg: the GNOME SVG rendering library</li>\n<li>resvg: the linebender Rust SVG renderer</li>\n</ul>",
