        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This adds docs for <code class=\"notranslate\">Permissions-Policy</code> directives <code class=\"notranslate\">clipboard-read</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">clipboard-write</code>. These were added in Chrome. One of these (read I think) was never in the spec, and the other was removed from the spec without consensus.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Anyway, these exist and higlight issues that users need to know about, so we should document them. I have avoided any of that discussion about history and treated them as non-standard (based on spec-presence). They follow same format as simpilar docs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Draft until the BCD gets reviewed <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5166922806\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30247\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30247/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30247\">mdn/browser-compat-data#30247</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work discussion <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5165835088\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45162\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45162/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45162\">#45162</a></p>",
